  "description": "Moraine CUES 10 is an all-mountain eMTB that lets you ride wherever your heart wants, without your legs and lungs disagreeing: think long days of ridgelines, rocky slopes, and perfect viewpoints. Moraine’s 6061-T6 aluminum frame and its playful geometry say “heck yes” to everything. The Fazua Ride 60 drive system encourages you further with 60Nm of torque and a 430Wh battery in a quiet, compact package. Moraine’s 145mm of Split Pivot rear suspension teams up with a 160mm fork for supportive and efficient pedaling and soaking up the terrain. Our on-bike storage keeps the essentials secured to your frame and the sweat off your back. Shimano’s CUES 10 drivetrain is a workhorse with everything you need (smooth shifting, durability, wide range) and nothing you don’t. Moraine makes big days in the mountains more fun.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
